            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After publication of the original article (1) it was noted that the title of this manuscript was incorrect. The title presently reads &quot;The cedar project: using indigenous-specific determinants of health to predict substance use among young pregnant-involved aboriginal women&quot; but should read &quot;The Cedar Project: Using Indigenous-specific determinants of health to predict substance use among young pregnant-involved Indigenous women in Canada&quot;.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
